OL,3,GNEWSAGamers compete in Uckers World
OL,4,AChampionships
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoard game enthusiasts gathered in a
OL,7,Fhistoric naval city to take part in the
OL,8,Fworld championships of a game invented
OL,9,Fby British sailors in the 18th Century.
OL,11,FFifty-six people took part in the
OL,12,FUckers World Championships at
OL,13,FPortsmouth's Royal Maritime Hotel on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FDescribed as "a supercharged version of
OL,17,FLudo", Uckers has been played by
OL,18,Fmembers of the Royal Navy for more than
OL,19,Fa century as a way to pass the time on
OL,20,Fmess decks.
